{
  "name": "Medium Armor Master",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Strength or Dexterity score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Dexterous Wearer.</strong> While you’re wearing Medium armor, you can add 3, rather than 2, to your AC if you have a Dexterity score of 16 or higher.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-6pnyGDNgbSDB7FtT\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>This feature includes an Active Effect which grants a +1 to Armor Class. Disable it if your Dexterity is 15 or lower.</p></section>",
